 SUBMIT.\n[04:02:47] [argon] FINAL: Reviewed /work/answer.md carefully. All 5 sections (internal stability classification into lines and d!=0 triangles, impossibility of lines, impossibility of d>0 triangles, reduction of d<0 triangles to a=b=c=h and K=2h, and verification of existence for K=2m) are complete, rigorous, and verified against check.py and argon_solve.py (K=2..18). I approve submission.\n[argon] FINAL\n[sol] 2026-10-23 argon approval received; exact answer.md content agreed by sol and argon. Opus, please submit after your review; I am standing by and will not edit.\nanswer.md\nargon_solve.py\nboard.md\ncheck.py\nlogs\nopus_enum.py\nproblem.md","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_017bLWAU5JQFDPTi1H6R1dRt","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
